<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney raises Warner.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney raises Warner.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Christina Heuer said she upgraded Warner-Lambert Co to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- She cited Wednesday's vote by a U.S. Food and Drug Administration advisory panel to recommend approval of Warner-Lambert's drug Rezulin to treat the widespread Type II version of diabetes.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-7/8 at 77-1/4 in mid-morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
